    "title": "watsonx AI Translator",
    "description": "Multi-format document translation using IBM watsonx.ai.\n\n**Supported formats:** PDF, DOCX, XLSX, PPTX, HTML, Markdown, plain text\n\n**Language pairs:** Any ↔ Any (Japanese, English, Portuguese, Spanish, French, German, …)",
    "version": "2.0.0"
  },
